   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "addEdge = always go there next.\naddConditionalEdges = a small function\nreads the state and picks the next node.\n\nThree decisions in the whole graph:\n  guardrail: allowed or END\n  coverage: missing or sufficient\n  critic: revision_needed or approved\n\nThe array in addEdge([...]) is the join:\nquery_generator waits for BOTH.\n\ncompile({ checkpointer }) = state saved\nafter every node, per thread_id.\nCached on globalThis so a Next.js hot\nreload doesn't reopen the database.",
   "originalText": "addEdge = always go there next.\naddConditionalEdges = a small function\nreads the state and picks the next node.\n\nThree decisions in the whole graph:\n  guardrail: allowed or END\n  coverage: missing or sufficient\n  critic: revision_needed or approved\n\nThe array in addEdge([...]) is the join:\nquery_generator waits for BOTH.\n\ncompile({ checkpointer }) = state saved\nafter every node, per thread_id.\nCached on globalThis so a Next.js hot\nreload doesn't reopen the database.",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
