   "text": "Free checks first: no LLM call, no cost.\nJAILBREAK regex: \"ignore previous instructions\",\n\"reveal your system prompt\" ...\nGibberish = more than half the words have\nno vowel or 5+ consonants in a row.\nnull does NOT mean safe: the LLM still checks.",
