   "text": "Verdict (zod): category · reason · suggestion.\nBlocked users get a suggested rewrite.\nThe catch is the design choice: FAIL OPEN.\n(The Medical RAG fails closed: there a\nrefusal is safe, here the critic and\ncitation checker still guard the output.)",
