   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The orchestrator doesn't research.\nWhy reset? The checkpointer KEEPS state\nbetween runs on the same thread, and append\nreducers would pile old logs onto new ones.\nOverwrite() bypasses the reducer.",
   "originalText": "The orchestrator doesn't research.\nWhy reset? The checkpointer KEEPS state\nbetween runs on the same thread, and append\nreducers would pile old logs onto new ones.\nOverwrite() bypasses the reducer.",
