   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Pure reasoning, no tools.\nEach sub-question is searched separately,\nso 'no overlap' saves search credits.\nslice(0, max): never trust the model's count.\nFallback: research the question as a whole.",
