   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "No LLM here: plain code, so it is fast\nand finishes while the Planner thinks.\n\ncfg.configurable carries thread_id and\nuser_id from runResearch().\n\nHybrid recall: BM25 finds same words,\nLanceDB finds same meaning. fuse() = RRF\n(k = 60), same idea as the Medical RAG.\n\nVectors down? keyword recall still works.\n\nOld evidence comes back as 'memory'\nchunks: no need to search for it again.\nIt still passes through mergeEvidence.",
   "originalText": "No LLM here: plain code, so it is fast\nand finishes while the Planner thinks.\n\ncfg.configurable carries thread_id and\nuser_id from runResearch().\n\nHybrid recall: BM25 finds same words,\nLanceDB finds same meaning. fuse() = RRF\n(k = 60), same idea as the Medical RAG.\n\nVectors down? keyword recall still works.\n\nOld evidence comes back as 'memory'\nchunks: no need to search for it again.\nIt still passes through mergeEvidence.",
