   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Two levels of parallel: all queries at once,\nand all channels per query at once.\nEvery .catch() turns a crash into a ToolError.\nOne failing site never stops the run.",
   "originalText": "Two levels of parallel: all queries at once,\nand all channels per query at once.\nEvery .catch() turns a crash into a ToolError.\nOne failing site never stops the run.",
