   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Fallback chain: first provider with hits wins.\nAn error OR zero results = try the next one.\nDuckDuckGo needs no key: always the last resort.\nCached 24 h in SQLite: a repeat costs nothing.",
   "originalText": "Fallback chain: first provider with hits wins.\nAn error OR zero results = try the next one.\nDuckDuckGo needs no key: always the last resort.\nCached 24 h in SQLite: a repeat costs nothing.",
