   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The cap is checked BEFORE the LLM call:\nthe loop can never run forever, and a\ncapped run doesn't even pay for the check.\n\nCoverage schema: perQuestion[{subQuestion,\ncovered, note}], verdict, gapAnalysis.\n\ngapAnalysis is the hand-off: the Query\nGenerator reads it on the next pass.\n\niterationCount only grows on 'missing'.\n\nThe router is 1 line: the node decides,\nthe edge just reads coverageStatus.",
   "originalText": "The cap is checked BEFORE the LLM call:\nthe loop can never run forever, and a\ncapped run doesn't even pay for the check.\n\nCoverage schema: perQuestion[{subQuestion,\ncovered, note}], verdict, gapAnalysis.\n\ngapAnalysis is the hand-off: the Query\nGenerator reads it on the next pass.\n\niterationCount only grows on 'missing'.\n\nThe router is 1 line: the node decides,\nthe edge just reads coverageStatus.",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
