   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The model gives scores; CODE decides.\napproved = all three ≥ 4, a rule you\ncan read, not the model's mood.\n\nThe guide left this loop uncapped. A picky\ncritic could loop forever, so the cap is\nchecked first, like Coverage.\n\nforced: true marks an approval that came\nfrom the cap, not from the review.\n\nbrief = concrete instructions that go\nstraight into the next Synthesis prompt.",
   "originalText": "The model gives scores; CODE decides.\napproved = all three ≥ 4, a rule you\ncan read, not the model's mood.\n\nThe guide left this loop uncapped. A picky\ncritic could loop forever, so the cap is\nchecked first, like Coverage.\n\nforced: true marks an approval that came\nfrom the cap, not from the review.\n\nbrief = concrete instructions that go\nstraight into the next Synthesis prompt.",
