   "locked": false,
   "text": "Main provider down → one try on the fallback.\nreserve() keeps a free tier under its\ntokens-per-minute and requests-per-minute.\nfit() shrinks the prompt if it won't fit.",
   "originalText": "Main provider down → one try on the fallback.\nreserve() keeps a free tier under its\ntokens-per-minute and requests-per-minute.\nfit() shrinks the prompt if it won't fit.",
