   "text": "The real graph runs; only the model is fake.\n\ncallStructured() checks the test hook first,\nso every node gets a scripted reply.\n\nIt proves the behaviour that matters:\n  both loops run, both caps stop them,\n  failures become data,\n  bad citations are removed,\n  blocked questions run nothing else.\n\nRuns in seconds, costs nothing, so it can\nrun before every deploy.",
   "originalText": "The real graph runs; only the model is fake.\n\ncallStructured() checks the test hook first,\nso every node gets a scripted reply.\n\nIt proves the behaviour that matters:\n  both loops run, both caps stop them,\n  failures become data,\n  bad citations are removed,\n  blocked questions run nothing else.\n\nRuns in seconds, costs nothing, so it can\nrun before every deploy.",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 19
